<title>JAPAN: RTRS-Queensland Treasury Corp launches yen/A$ samurais.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Queensland Treasury Corp launches yen/A$ samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Queensland Treasury Corp (QTC) on Friday launched 30 billion yen worth of 5.5 percent yen/Australian dollar dual currency samurai bonds due on October 15, 1998, lead-manager Nomura Securities said.</p>
<p>The bonds are priced at par and are guaranteed by the state of Queensland.</p>
</text>
